OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAVauxhall Bridge 'could have to
OL,4,Ashut to buses'
OL,5,
OL,6,FVauxhall Bridge will have to shut to
OL,7,Fbuses and fire engines within two to
OL,8,Ffour years unless about #60m is
OL,9,Finvested in repairs, Transport for
OL,10,FLondon (TfL) has warned.
OL,12,FThe crossing, which is the busiest
OL,13,Fbridge in central London, could even
OL,14,Fhave to close fully to vehicles in four
OL,15,Fto 10 years without the necessary work,
OL,16,Fit said.
OL,18,FTfL has applied to the government's
OL,19,F#1bn structures fund for the money,
OL,20,Fwith the successful bids due to be
OL,21,Fannounced soon.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
