OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F323A1794981350
OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAVauxhall Bridge 'could have to
OL,4,Ashut to buses'
OL,5,
OL,6,FDavid Rowe, TfL's director of
OL,7,Finvestment planning, told BBC London
OL,8,Fthat the bridge's waterproofing had
OL,9,F"failed" and "we will see progressive
OL,10,Fdeterioration unless action is taken,
OL,11,Fwhich is why these bids are so
OL,12,Fimportant for us".
